msgid ""
"The autopilot includes a DroneCAN power module and battery monitor, "
":ref:`common-can-pmu`. Connect to one of the CAN ports and it is already "
"pre-configured for use."
msgstr ""
"飞控包含 DroneCAN 电源模块和电池监测器，:ref:`common-can-pmu`。连接到其中一个 CAN 端口，已预配置好可直接使用。"

